">60mg</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-border/50 py-2.5 last:border-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-foreground-muted\">Purity (HPLC)</dt><dd class=\"text-[14px] text-foreground text-right\">99.867%</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-border/50 py-2.5 last:border-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-foreground-muted\">Expected content</dt><dd class=\"text-[14px] text-foreground text-right\">60.00 mg</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-border/50 py-2.5 last:border-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-foreground-muted\">Measured mass</dt><dd class=\"text-[14px] text-foreground text-right\">67.71 mg</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-border/50 py-2.5 last:border-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-foreground-muted\">Fill accuracy</dt><dd class=\"text-[14px] text-foreground text-right\">112.8%</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-border/50 py-2.5 last:border-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-foreground-muted\">Verification lab</dt><dd class=\"text-[14px] text-foreground text-right\">Janoshik</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-border/50 py-2.5 last:border-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-foreground-muted\">Test date</dt><dd class=\"text-[14px] text-foreground text-right\">2026-08-04</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-border/50 py-2.5 last:border-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-foreground-muted\">Format</dt><dd class=\"text-[14px] text-foreground text-right\">Lyophilized powder</dd></div></dl></div><div class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">Why fill accuracy matters</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Purity tells you what fraction of the material in the vial is the target compound. It tells you nothing about how much material is in the vial. A vial can assay at 99.8% purity and hold 7 mg against a 10 mg label — the purity figure is accurate and the vial is still short.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Fill accuracy is the measured mass against the expected content:<!-- --> <!-- -->67.71<!-- --> mg measured against <!-- -->60.00<!-- --> mg expected, or<!-- --> <!-- -->112.8<!-- -->%. Both numbers are published for every Eppix batch.</p></div><section class=\"mt-10 max-w-2xl\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">How to read this certificate</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Two separate tests sit behind the table above.<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-medium text-foreground\">Identity</strong> is established by mass spectrometry: the measured molecular mass is compared against the mass calculated from the compound’s published sequence or formula, and a match within the instrument’s tolerance is what confirms the material is <!-- -->Tirzepatide<!-- --> rather than something else.<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-medium text-foreground\">Purity</strong> is established by reversed-phase HPLC and reported as area percent — the fraction of the total chromatographic signal belonging to the main peak.<!-- --> For this lot that figure is 99.867%.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Area percent is a relative measure, not an absolute one. It says what share of the detected material is the target compound; it says nothing about how much material is in the vial, which is why measured mass is reported alongside it rather than instead of it. A certificate that publishes purity and withholds mass has answered the easier of the two questions.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">The working threshold for research-grade peptide material is 98% by HPLC area, with 99% and above the range reputable synthesis routinely reaches.<!-- --> At 99.867%, this lot sits inside that range.<!-- --> <!-- -->Nothing on this page is rounded, restated or re-tested in-house: the certificate is <!-- -->Janoshik<!-- -->’s<!-- --> and carries their test date of 2026-08-04<!-- -->.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">New to reading these?<!-- --> <a class=\"text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline\" href=\"/peptide-research/how-to-read-a-certificate-of-analysis\">How to read a certificate of analysis</a> <!-- -->walks through a full report field by field, and<!-- --> <a class=\"text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline\" href=\"/peptide-research/purity-vs-fill-accuracy\">purity vs fill accuracy</a> <!-- -->covers why the two numbers have to be read together.</p></section><div class=\"mt-8\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\">Full report</h2><div class=\"glass rounded-card border border-border/60 p-3\"><img alt=\"Certificate of Analysis for Tirzepatide batch TIRZ-CA-26F-60\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1400\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-lg\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" src=\"/reference/f241c6be2033941ec868.webp\"></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-[14px]\"><a href=\"https://verify.janoshik.com/tests/200363-Tirzepatide_60mg_Eppix_Labs_H4B24JA39Y81\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline\">Open the <!-- -->Janoshik<!-- --> report for this batch →</a><a class=\"text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline\" href=\"/products/tirzepatide\">Buy <!-- -->Tirzepatide<!-- --> →</a><a class=\"text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline\" href=\"/certificates-of-analysis/tirzepatide\">Full <!-- -->Tirzepatide<!-- --> lot history →</a><a class=\"text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline\" href=\"/verify\">Verify another batch →</a><a class=\"text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline\" href=\"/certificates-of-analysis\">All batches →</a></div><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">Previous batches of <!-- -->Tirzepatide</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl\">Every lot of <!-- -->Tirzepatide<!-- --> we have published, newest first. Consistency across lots is visible here in a way a single certificate cannot show.</p><ul class=\"mt-4 divide-y divide-border/60 border-y border-border/60\"><li><a class=\"group flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-4 gap-y-1 py-3\" href=\"/certificates-of-analysis/tirz-ca-26g-15\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] tracking-[0.06em] text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 group-hover:underline\">TIRZ-CA-26G-15</span><span class=\"text-[12px] text-foreground-secondary\">15mg</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground-secondary\">99.888<!-- -->% purity</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground-secondary\">118.3<!-- -->% fill</span><span class=\"ml-auto font-mono text-[11px] text-foreground-muted\">2026-08-25</span></a></li><li><a class=\"group flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-4 gap-y-1 py-3\" href=\"/certificates-of-analysis/tirz-ca-26g-10\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] tracking-[0.06em] text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 group-hover:underline\">TIRZ-CA-26G-10</span><span class=\"text-[12px] text-foreground-secondary\">10mg</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground-secondary\">99.634<!-- -->% purity</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground-secondary\">114.2<!-- -->% fill</span><span class=\"ml-auto font-mono text-[11px] text-foreground-muted\">2026-08-04</span></a></li><li><a class=\"group flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-4 gap-y-1 py-3\" href=\"/certificates-of-analysis/tirz-ca-26a-01\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] tracking-[0.06em] text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 group-hover:underline\">TIRZ-CA-26A-01</span><span class=\"text-[12px] text-foreground-secondary\">30mg</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground-secondary\">99.82<!-- -->% purity</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground-secondary\">110.6<!-- -->% fill</span><span class=\"ml-auto font-mono text-[11px] text-foreground-muted\">2026-06-03</span></a></li></ul></section><p class=\"mt-10 text-[12px] text-foreground-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl\">Research use only. Materials supplied by Eppix Labs are intended strictly for in-vitro laboratory research. Not for human or veterinary use, and not for the diagnosis, treatment, cure or prevention of any condition.</p></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><div class=\"no-overflow-x\"><footer class=\"glass\"><div class=\"border-b border-white/30 dark:border-border\"><ul class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-1.5 px-4 py-4 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-4 text-[12.5px] text-foreground-secondary\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Independent lab report published for every lot</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>99.48% mean HPLC purity, all lots</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Same-day dispatch before 4 pm · Xpresspost 1–2 days</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Free shipping over $200 · Mix &amp; Match up to 25%</li></